{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1340,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Band Treaty prohibits all nuclear explosions anywhere on Earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6140,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for any purpose, period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7740,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Though as of 2015, it still remains to be signed and/or locally ratified in a few important places."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12740,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In spite of this, the Test-Band preparatory commission has already developed a monitoring system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16900,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can detect pretty much any nuclear explosion that takes place anywhere on, above, or inside the Earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22440,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's how it works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23640,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nuclear explosions release a lot of energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26460,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much of it in the form of blast waves that radiate outwards through the air, water, or ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30600,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These waves travel at the speed of sound in the air, water, or rock"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34080,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if you detect them in multiple places you can triangulate exactly where and when the blast occurred."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38980,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simple in principle, complicated in practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42220,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Atmospheric explosions are monitored by a global network of infra-sound detectors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46580,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They detect the super-long wavelength, low frequency sound waves generated by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50160,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "storms, glaciers, volcanic eruptions, meteor impacts, rocket launches, space shuttle disasters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55240,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yes, nuclear explosions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57420,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, nuclear explosions are so much more intense than pretty much anything else"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60920,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that happens in the atmosphere, that an atmospheric blast is pretty easy to detect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65000,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Underwater detonations are monitored by hydro-acoustic sensors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68560,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically, super sensitive underwater microphones floating above the ocean floor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72540,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like in the atmosphere, underwater nuclear blasts are pretty easy to detect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because there's just nothing else that violent that happens in the oceans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79900,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Underground explosions are the tough ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82540,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're monitored using seismometers, the same tools that detect earthquakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86260,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as you might expect, they mainly detect earthquakes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89320,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Big earthquakes, small earthquakes, and lots of tiny earthquakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93380,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and volcanic eruptions, and mining explosions, and even airplane crashes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97280,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scientists have gotten to know these non-nuclear blasts pretty well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100660,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so when they saw large unusual disturbances beneath North Korea in 2006, 2009, and 2013"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106900,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they concluded correctly, that these were nuclear explosions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110400,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, while all three wave techniques"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112820,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "waves in air, waves in water, and waves in earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115360,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can triangulate the location of a major disturbance and even give some insight into its nature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119940,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a fourth technique is critical in order to know, for sure, if an explosion was nuclear or not:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124900,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Radionuclide Detection."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126640,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AD stations around the world sample the air for radioactive dust and gases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130800,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are smoking gun signals of nuclear activity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133320,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which, combined with sophisticated atmospheric air flow modeling allows us to both"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137400,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "predict where fallout will disperse, and retrodict the general location of its source."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141860,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the case of a perfectly contained secret underground or deep ocean explosion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146320,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there might be no radioactive fallout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148700,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if seismographs and hydro-acoustic sensors pick up a suspicious signal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152080,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's one final weapon in the international monitoring system's arsenal:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155560,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sending on the ground inspection teams to the actual location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158900,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except, inspection teams won't actually be legal until the treaty is fully signed and ratified."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163920,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*cough cough*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164420,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's you, U.S., China, Israel, Egypt, Iran, India, Pakistan, and North Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168160,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The world is waiting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172340,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was made possible by the comprehensive test-ban treaty organization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176280,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "though any political views expressed are my own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178500,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on America, let's ratify the treaty now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180480,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The CTBTO preparatory commission developed and implemented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183640,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the international monitoring system I described"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185600,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're constantly seeking to improve the sensitivity of their sensors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188640,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the sophistication of their data analysis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190940,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also make all their data available to the worldwide scientific community"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194180,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that other researchers can, for example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196060,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "predict and monitor tsunamis, study the structure of the Earth, search for downed airplanes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do their own analysis of nuclear blasts, or track whale migrations, or meteors in the upper atmosphere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204400,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or radioactive fallout from nuclear power plant failures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207120,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In short, the CTBTO is a collaborative endeavor of people around the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210860,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using science to help prevent people from doing horrible things to each other with science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214820,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in the process they happen to be generating a lot of positive scientific side effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219120,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The CTBTO didn't ask me to say this, but after learning about their work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222420,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to thank them for making the world a safer place for millions, if not billions of people."
    } ]
  } ]
}
